e e-terrorists will be myself, as they'll hack my accounts and &quot;steal&quot; all their funding while neglecting to take the money from the modest savings and investments I'd use to remove the need for me to work. Between insurance payouts and loss of incriminating data it will never come to light I was involved as anything but a victim. in the meantime various obstructive special interest groups, politicos, and corporate entities will be plagued by everything from vandals to assassins and I can sit back and watch the chaos unfold.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-13T09:51:07-08:00","id":1470349,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darksol-aeternium</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1470089-how-would-you-spend-a-trillion-dollars?p=1470347#post1470347\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmm.....<br /> Nonprofits get tangled in legality and corrupted.<br /> Corporate policy makers inflate the world in the face of charities or handouts.<br /> Bandits, conmen, and warlords make distribution of funds to the needy impossible.<br /> Revolutionary research for medical cures and such gets blocked by stale old policy &amp; politics.<br /> No politician can clean up ANY